# boss-tempest-body
grid      64x64
fudge     0.70 x 1.00
pivot     32 56
palette   0 #0A0A12 outline
palette   2 #3F92EC tank blue light
palette   3 #145DBD blue (Tempest Man primary)
palette   4 #0E3F8C blue shade
palette   6 #FFF4A8 brass highlight
palette   7 #F5C518 brass (Tempest Man secondary)
palette   8 #C28A12 brass shade
palette   9 #7A5208 brass deep
palette   a #EEF2F7 steel highlight
palette   c #6B7686 steel
palette   d #3A424E steel deep
palette   e #7CF6FF his eye, the teal glass (the sclera)
palette   f #D0603A mine rust light
palette   g #9A3A1E mine rust
palette   h #57200F mine rust deep
note      Drawn by Claude at the owner's request, 2026-11-16, from the picks on the "Tempest Man Art" canvas: body 16 (ball joints, the mine), the tank behind him with its bar blended in, hop 6, divebomb 01 with thrusters A, charge 2 with rear bells B. Each frame's spawn point is the tank bar's top-left corner; the game draws the bar's level there and the water out of the nozzles below it.

